# ==============================================================================
# 🛡️ SecSentinel — Coleção Interativa de Requisições (VS Code / Cursor REST Client)
# ==============================================================================
# Como usar:
# 1. Instale a extensão "REST Client" (Huachao Mao) no VS Code ou Cursor.
# 2. Suba o ambiente com: `make setup && make up`
# 3. Clique em "Send Request" acima da requisição [2. Login ADMIN] para capturar
#    automaticamente o `access_token` e `refresh_token` nas variáveis abaixo!
# ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@adminEmail = admin@secsentinel.local
@adminPassword = senha123
@devEmail = dev@secsentinel.local
@devPassword = SecSentinel#2026!
@seededScanId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 1.1 Liveness Probe (Verifica se o processo FastAPI/ASGI está vivo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Readiness & Deep Health Check Realista (Testa ativamente PostgreSQL + Redis)
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 Readiness Probe Alias (Compatível com convenção Kubernetes /ready)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready
Accept: application/json

# ==============================================================================
# 🔐 AUTENTICAÇÃO JWT & RBAC
# ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Login com Usuário ADMIN do Seed (Captura automática do Token JWT!)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Variáveis dinâmicas extraídas automaticamente da resposta do Login acima:
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refresh_token}}

### 2.2 Consultar Perfil do Usuário Autenticado (GET /api/v1/auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 Verificar Acesso Administrativo RBAC (Exclusivo ADMIN e AUDITOR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin-audit-check
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 Rotação Segura de Par JWT via Refresh Token (Token Rotation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 2.5 Registrar Novo Usuário DEVELOPER (Validação OWASP ASVS + Anti-Mass Assignment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "qa.recruiter@secsentinel.io",
  "password": "StrongRecruiter#2026!"
}

# ==============================================================================
# 🔬 AUDITORIAS DE SEGURANÇA (SCANS) & RELATÓRIO EXECUTIVO CI/CD
# ==============================================================================

### 3.1 Consultar Relatório Executivo do Scan Pré-Populado pelo Seed (Veredito BLOCK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scans/{{seededScanId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Consultar Detalhes Brutos do Scan Pré-Populado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scans/{{seededScanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.3 Disparar Novo Scan Assíncrono (PR Audit: Secret Scanner + SAST AST)
# @name enqueueScan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target_url": "https://github.com/acme-corp/checkout-service/pull/108",
  "scan_type": "pr_audit",
  "code_snippet": "import os\nimport subprocess\n\nAWS_KEY = \"AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE\"\n\ndef run_report(user_input: str):\n    eval(user_input)\n    subprocess.run(f\"echo {user_input}\", shell=True)\n"
}

### Captura automática do ID do Scan recém-enfileirado:
@newScanId = {{enqueueScan.response.body.scan_id}}

### 3.4 Consultar Relatório Executivo do Novo Scan Processado pelo Celery Worker
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scans/{{newScanId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

# ==============================================================================
# 🛡️ DEMONSTRAÇÃO DE DEFESA EM PROFUNDIDADE (TESTES DE SEGURANÇA NEGATIVOS)
# ==============================================================================

### 4.1 Teste de Bloqueio Anti-SSRF (Tentativa de acessar AWS Cloud Metadata 169.254.169.254 -> HTTP 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target_url": "http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/iam/security-credentials/",
  "scan_type": "api_audit"
}

### 4.2 Teste de Bloqueio Anti-Mass Assignment (Tentativa de injetar role="admin" no registro -> HTTP 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "evil.hacker@secsentinel.io",
  "password": "StrongPassword#2026!",
  "role": "admin"
}
